message: "If you use CERA in research, please cite the archived software release once its DOI is assigned."
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CERA: Holdout-Checked Projection Screening for Minority-Cluster Recovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Galiatsatos"
    given-names: "Dimitrios"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5232-1425"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dgaliatsatos2010/CERA"
abstract: >-
  CERA is an exploratory unsupervised clustering implementation with a
  holdout-checked projection screening mechanism for some minority-cluster settings.
  It makes no claim of controlled type-I error or universal superiority.
